<section>
    <h3>Mode Replay</h3>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 960 380" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width: 100%; max-height: 440px;" font-family="sans-serif" role="img" aria-label="En mode Replay, la requête est masquée puis comparée aux entrées du fichier HAR ; trouvée, la réponse est rejouée sans réseau, absente, une exception est levée">
        <defs>
            <marker id="arr-rep" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
                <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#64748B"/>
            </marker>
            <marker id="arr-rep-green" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
                <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#059669"/>
            </marker>
            <marker id="arr-rep-red" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
                <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#DC2626"/>
            </marker>
        </defs>

        <!-- Fichier -->
        <rect x="770" y="16" width="170" height="64" rx="10" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#142B43" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6 4"/>
        <text x="855" y="54" text-anchor="middle" fill="#142B43" font-size="17" font-weight="bold">testX.har</text>
        <line x1="855" y1="80" x2="855" y2="126" stroke="#64748B" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-rep)"/>

        <!-- Requête -->
        <rect x="20" y="130" width="170" height="84" rx="10" fill="#F8FAFC" stroke="#D9DEE5" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="105" y="178" text-anchor="middle" fill="#142B43" font-size="18" font-weight="bold">Votre test</text>

        <rect x="230" y="130" width="200" height="84" rx="10" fill="#FEF2F2" stroke="#F04444" stroke-width="2.5"/>
        <text x="330" y="178" text-anchor="middle" fill="#142B43" font-size="17" font-weight="bold">RecorderHttpClient</text>

        <rect x="475" y="130" width="200" height="84" rx="10" fill="#FFFBEB" stroke="#D97706" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="575" y="164" text-anchor="middle" fill="#142B43" font-size="17" font-weight="bold">DefaultRedactor</text>
        <text x="575" y="190" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748B" font-size="14">masque la requête</text>

        <rect x="720" y="130" width="220" height="84" rx="10" fill="#F5F3FF" stroke="#7C3AED" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="830" y="164" text-anchor="middle" fill="#142B43" font-size="17" font-weight="bold">DefaultMatcher</text>
        <text x="830" y="190" text-anchor="middle" fill="#64748B" font-size="14">méthode, URL, corps</text>

        <line x1="190" y1="172" x2="226" y2="172" stroke="#64748B" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-rep)"/>
        <line x1="430" y1="172" x2="471" y2="172" stroke="#64748B" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-rep)"/>
        <line x1="675" y1="172" x2="716" y2="172" stroke="#64748B" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-rep)"/>

        <!-- Trouvée -->
        <g class="fragment">
            <path d="M745,214 V328 H679" fill="none" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-rep-green)"/>
            <text x="712" y="318" text-anchor="middle" fill="#059669" font-size="14" font-weight="bold">trouvée</text>
            <rect x="230" y="290" width="445" height="76" rx="10" fill="#F0FDF4" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="452" y="322" text-anchor="middle" fill="#142B43" font-size="17" font-weight="bold">Réponse rejouée par MockHttpClient</text>
            <text x="452" y="348" text-anchor="middle" fill="#059669" font-size="15">aucun appel réseau</text>
            <path d="M230,328 H105 V218" fill="none" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-rep-green)"/>
        </g>

        <!-- Absente -->
        <g class="fragment">
            <line x1="880" y1="214" x2="880" y2="286" stroke="#DC2626" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arr-rep-red)"/>
            <text x="888" y="256" fill="#DC2626" font-size="14" font-weight="bold">absente</text>
            <rect x="780" y="290" width="160" height="76" rx="10" fill="#FEF2F2" stroke="#DC2626" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <text x="860" y="322" text-anchor="middle" fill="#142B43" font-size="16" font-weight="bold">Exception</text>
            <text x="860" y="348" text-anchor="middle" fill="#DC2626" font-size="14">le test échoue</text>
        </g>
    </svg>
    <p class="fragment subtitle" style="font-size: 0.55em; margin-top: 0;">
        Avec <code>recordIfMissing: true</code>, une entrée absente déclenche le vrai appel, qui est enregistré.
    </p>
    <aside class="notes">
        En Replay, la requête du test est masquée de la même façon que lors de l'enregistrement, puis comparée aux entrées du fichier. Trouvée : MockHttpClient sert la réponse. Absente : HarEntryNotFoundException, et surtout aucun appel réseau, sauf opt-in explicite avec recordIfMissing.
    </aside>
</section>
